      "review_description": "1. Your three quotes were quite similar to the one I chose through an external installer2. I knew someone who used to work with my chosen installer and that they were known for high quality work3. None of the Solarquotes installers offered to come to the premises to discuss a final design4. I would not have hesitated to go with any of your recommended installers, they were all quality installers5. I have already recommended your website to someone who is about to find an installer6. your website should be first stop for people considering to install solar systemsThank you",
