      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Proper in house electricians and not subbies. Totally professional. Not only did they install just over 3kw of new system. They rewired and brought up to current specs my existing 3kw system. Now I have 1 system all totally certified to current specs. Brand new 6 kw Fronius Symo Inverter has the entire system wired to it across all 3 phases and making sure we get best deal from electricity supplier. New panels are top tier 1 quality.Plenty of cheaper quotes but always cutting corners.LJW Solar sent a team of 4 people who did a great job with a very pleasant and helpful attitude.",
