      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Two companies at first were reluctant to make an on-site assessment and quote and wanted to communicate solely by Google maps of the property, scans of previous electricity bills, email and phone.I was not particularly interested in either company but one persisted and an on-site assessment was made.  Both companies provided quotes in the $3,000+ range.  This company then made persistent phone calls regarding their quote and whether I was going to take it. The company I chose was recommended by neighbours who had solar installed by them over five years ago.  Their quote was more expensive but I felt far more confident about their ability to follow through and their warranties, as well as their products and history.",
